From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: stage disabled SM8750 CCI and camera MCLK resources

Rebase the CCI and MCLK-only additions by Hangxiang Ma from
20260618-pakala-camera-v2-{2,3}-9fbb729fd242@oss.qualcomm.com onto
7a81d184e3098624d4342d8f4eff5e23674bcc9f. The original messages and hashes
remain in patches/sm8750-dtsi-v2 and sources.json. Original Reviewed-by
and Signed-off-by trailers remain in those original messages, not forged here.
The upstream series was rejected pending driver dependencies. All three CCI
controllers remain disabled, and this patch adds no sensor or CAMSS node.
Original device-tree source licensing remains BSD-3-Clause.

